📄 Complete README.md File (Copy-Paste Ready)
Bhai, ye poora professional README hai. Isko README.md file mein paste kar de. Interviewer ko pehli nazar mein impress karega.

📥 STEP 1: README.md File Banao
Terminal / CMD mein:
cmd
notepad README.md
(Ya VS Code se: code README.md)

📝 STEP 2: Ye Content Paste Kar
markdown
<div align="center">

# 🚀 AI Enterprise HR Strategy Agent

### *Transforming Workforce Data into Strategic Decisions with ML & LLMs*

An AI-powered HR intelligence platform that analyzes workforce trends, predicts hiring demand, recommends training programs, and supports organizational planning.

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-3776AB?style=for-the-badge&logo=python&logoColor=white)](https://python.org)
