⚠️ Note: File ka naam exactly .gitignore hona chahiye (starting dot ke saath, koi extension nahi).

Notepad se banate waqt: Save As → File name: ".gitignore" (double quotes ke saath) → Save as type: All Files → Save

📝 STEP 2: Ye Content Paste Kar
gitignore
# ============================================
# AI Enterprise HR Strategy Agent - .gitignore
# ============================================

# --------------------------------------------
# 🐍 PYTHON / BACKEND
# --------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
.venv/
.python-version

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Unit test / coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints

# IPython
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# pyenv
.python-version

# pip
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
Pipfile.lock

# Poetry
poetry.lock

# --------------------------------------------
# 🔐 ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (SECRETS)
# --------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env.*.local
*.env

# --------------------------------------------
# 🤖 ML MODELS (Large files)
# --------------------------------------------
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.model
*.weights
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

# Keep folder structure but ignore models
backend/ml/saved_models/*
!backend/ml/saved_models/.gitkeep

# --------------------------------------------
# 🗄️ DATABASE
# --------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
hr_data.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# --------------------------------------------
# 📊 DATA FILES (Large)
# --------------------------------------------
backend/data/raw/*.csv
backend/data/processed/*.csv
!backend/data/raw/.gitkeep
!backend/data/processed/.gitkeep
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5

# --------------------------------------------
# 📁 LOGS
# --------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
log/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# --------------------------------------------
# ⚛️ NODE / REACT / FRONTEND
# --------------------------------------------
node_modules/
node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.pnp.cjs

# Yarn
.yarn/
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions
.yarn-integrity

# npm
npm-debug.log*
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# --------------------------------------------
# 🏗️ BUILD OUTPUT
# --------------------------------------------
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
.vuepress/dist/
.serverless/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.vite/
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/

# --------------------------------------------
# 🎨 EDITORS & IDEs
# --------------------------------------------
# VS Code
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json

# JetBrains (PyCharm, WebStorm, IntelliJ)
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# Sublime Text
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# Vim
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vim/
.nvim/

# Emacs
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# --------------------------------------------
# 💻 OPERATING SYSTEM
# --------------------------------------------
# macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
*.stackdump

# Linux
*~
.directory
.Trash-*

# --------------------------------------------
# 🧪 TESTING
# --------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/
.bandit

# --------------------------------------------
# 🐳 DOCKER
# --------------------------------------------
docker-compose.override.yml

# --------------------------------------------
# ☁️ DEPLOYMENT
# --------------------------------------------
.vercel
.netlify
.firebase/
.heroku/
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# --------------------------------------------
# 📦 TEMP / CACHE
# --------------------------------------------
tmp/
temp/
.temp/
.cache/
.tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
.crdownload
.part

# --------------------------------------------
# 🔒 SECURITY
# --------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
secrets.json
credentials.json

# --------------------------------------------
# 📱 MOBILE / MISC
# --------------------------------------------
.expo/
.expo-shared/
*.tgz

# --------------------------------------------
# 📝 BACKUP FILES
# --------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*~
*.orig

# --------------------------------------------
# 🚫 PROJECT SPECIFIC
# --------------------------------------------
# Gemini API keys / secret configs
gemini_key.txt
api_keys.txt

# Model training artifacts
backend/ml/saved_models/*.pkl
backend/ml/saved_models/*.joblib
backend/ml/*.log

# Prediction cache
backend/data/predictions_cache/

# --------------------------------------------
# ✅ KEEP THESE (Whitelist)
# --------------------------------------------
!.gitkeep
!backend/data/raw/.gitkeep
!backend/data/processed/.gitkeep
!backend/ml/saved_models/.gitkeep
!.env.example
!README.md
!LICENSE
📤 STEP 3: Save + Push
bash
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "add .gitignore"
git push
🚨 AGAR PEHLE SE FILES PUSH HO CHUKI HAIN
Agar node_modules/, venv/, .env, ya *.pkl already GitHub pe chali gayi hain, toh unhe remove karna padega:

Step 1: Cache Clear Karo
bash
git rm -r --cached .
Step 2: Sab Re-add Karo (Ab .gitignore apply hoga)
bash
git add .
Step 3: Commit + Push
bash
git commit -m "apply gitignore and remove tracked junk files"
git push
🎯 SPECIFIC FILES KO TRACKING SE HATAO (Agar Sirf Kuch Files Remove Karni Hain)
node_modules remove:
bash
git rm -r --cached frontend/node_modules
git commit -m "remove node_modules"
git push
venv remove:
bash
git rm -r --cached backend/venv
git commit -m "remove venv"
git push
.env remove:
bash
git rm --cached backend/.env
git commit -m "remove .env"
git push
*.pkl models remove:
bash
git rm --cached backend/ml/saved_models/*.pkl
git commit -m "remove model files"
git push
hr_data.db remove:
bash
git rm --cached hr_data.db
git rm --cached backend/hr_data.db
git commit -m "remove database"
git push
✅ FINAL CHECKLIST
Repo mein ye files NAHI honi chahiye:

❌ node_modules/

❌ venv/ ya .venv/

❌ .env (actual keys)

❌ *.pkl model files

❌ *.db / *.sqlite

❌ __pycache__/

❌ dist/ / build/

❌ .DS_Store

❌ Log files

Repo mein ye files HONI CHAHIYE:

✅ .gitignore

✅ README.md

✅ LICENSE

✅ .env.example (template only)

✅ All .py, .jsx, .js, .json source files

✅ requirements.txt

✅ package.json

✅ .gitkeep files in empty folders

💡 BONUS: .env.example Bhi Bana Le
cmd
notepad backend\.env.example
Paste karo:

env
# Gemini API Configuration
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./hr_data.db

# Server Configuration
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
DEBUG=True

# CORS
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173
Push karo:

bash
git add backend/.env.example
git commit -m "add env example template"
git push
🎯 ONE-SHOT FULL COMMANDS (Copy-Paste)
bash
# Create .gitignore (already content pasted manually)
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "add comprehensive .gitignore"
git push
Agar pehle hi junk files push ho chuki hain:

bash
git rm -r --cached .
git add .
git commit -m "clean repo with gitignore"
git push
Bas bhai! Ab tera repo clean aur professional rahega — sirf source code push hoga, koi junk nahi. 🚀

Koi error aaye toh screenshot bhej, fix bata dunga.


