📄 Complete .gitignore File
Bhai, ye complete .gitignore file hai — Python (backend) + React (frontend) + ML models + DB + env sab cover karta hai. Isko project root mein rakhna.

📥 STEP 1: File Banao
Terminal / CMD mein:
cmd
notepad .gitignore
(Ya VS Code se: code .gitignore)

⚠️ Note: File ka naam exactly .gitignore hona chahiye (starting dot ke saath, koi extension nahi).

Notepad se banate waqt: Save As → File name: ".gitignore" (double quotes ke saath) → Save as type: All Files → Save

📝 STEP 2: Ye Content Paste Kar
